# The built binary (Makefile: `build` -> ./agentloop).
# `!cmd/agentloop/` un-ignores the SOURCE directory of the same name — without
# it the bare pattern above also matched the directory and silently hid every
# new file added under cmd/agentloop/ (found the hard way: cmd/agentloop/
# debug_test.go had been invisible to git).
agentloop
!cmd/agentloop/
